						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5d18120c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5d18120c" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:&quot;300&quot;,&quot;_animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Experts in  wand- en plafondafwerking</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-78cd77e0 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="78cd77e0" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:&quot;600&quot;,&quot;_animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Wil je gladde muren en plafonds in je woning? Wij ontzorgen je in de complete wand- en plafondafwerking, van dunpleisterwerk en latex spuitwerk tot houtschilderwerk. Zo ben je verzekerd van een strak, sausklaar en egaal eindresultaat, ideaal voor nieuwbouw en renovatie.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6b3b99a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="6b3b99a" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:&quot;300&quot;,&quot;_animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Benieuwd hoe wij te werk gaan?</h2>				</div>
